---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="terms · tracelane"
  description="terms of service for tracelane.dev and the tracelane software."
>
  <section class="container-prose py-24">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs text-fg-dim mb-4 tracking-wider lowercase">
      terms of service
    </p>
    <h1
      class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg lowercase"
    >
      terms.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-fg-muted leading-relaxed">
      this page covers tracelane.dev — the marketing site. paid hosted tiers
      and self-hosted commercial use will have separate detailed terms at v1
      launch.
    </p>

    <h2
      class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg lowercase"
    >
      software license
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-fg-muted lowercase leading-relaxed">
      the tracelane core is licensed under
      <a
        href="https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0"
        class="underline decoration-fg-subtle hover:decoration-fg transition-colors"
        rel="noopener"
      >
        Apache 2.0
      </a>. the
      <code class="font-mono text-fg">/ee</code>
       directory is covered by the Tracelane Enterprise License (paid-tier
      features). the
      <code class="font-mono text-fg">/spec</code>
       directory is CC0.
    </p>

    <h2
      class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg lowercase"
    >
      site content license
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-fg-muted lowercase leading-relaxed">
      the content on tracelane.dev (text, structure, design) is licensed
      <a
        href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"
        class="underline decoration-fg-subtle hover:decoration-fg transition-colors"
        rel="noopener"
      >
        CC-BY-4.0
      </a>. you may reuse with attribution. third-party brand names mentioned
      on this site (Anthropic, OpenAI, Cloudflare, Helicone, LiteLLM, etc.)
      remain the property of their owners.
    </p>

    <h2
      class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg lowercase"
    >
      paid tiers + payment processing
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-fg-muted lowercase leading-relaxed">
      paid tiers will be processed via
      <a
        href="https://polar.sh"
        class="underline decoration-fg-subtle hover:decoration-fg transition-colors"
        rel="noopener"
      >
        Polar.sh
      </a>
       as the merchant of record at v1 launch. Polar.sh handles global tax
      collection (EU VAT, US sales tax, India GST, ~50 countries). detailed
      subscription terms will appear at checkout.
    </p>

    <h2
      class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg lowercase"
    >
      no warranty
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-fg-muted lowercase leading-relaxed">
      the software and the site are provided "as is" under the Apache 2.0
      license, without warranty of any kind. nothing on this site constitutes
      a binding commitment to ship features, dates, or SLAs until contractual
      terms are signed.
    </p>

    <h2
      class="mt-16 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg lowercase"
    >
      contact
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-fg-muted lowercase leading-relaxed">
      questions about these terms — <code class="font-mono text-fg">support@tracelane.dev</code>.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-16 text-sm text-fg-subtle lowercase">
      last updated: may 20, 2026.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
